<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99574" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συναυλ-ία</span></b>  (A), ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>concert of lyre and flute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.617f
			</span></i> (prob. from <i><span class="en">
				Ephipp.
				7
			</span></i>); <i>symphony of flutes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.83
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: generally, <i>instrumental music, concert</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονῳδία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				765b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ᾄδειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					47.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυναυλίαν κλαύσωμεν Οὐλύμπου
				νόμον</span> to sob or whimper one of Olympus' pieces <i>in
				concert</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσορνις ἅδε ξ. δορός</span> this
			ill-omened <i>concert</i> of battle, of the single combat of the
			brothers, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				839
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. θρήνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					61.20
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
